      "content": "oh okay i didn't realize it was that serious. i was worried about missing out on protein though. if i don't eat a huge amount, like just a little bit of feta or some deli ham once in a while, is it really gonna be a problem? it's not like i'm eating a whole block of cheese at once lol",
